From: Shail Parmar <shailparmar26@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Feb 2026 12:43:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] rkaiq: iqfiles: support for imx519 arducam

add iqfile for the arducam 16MP camera (IMX519).

The tuning is being done in vicharak lab, further tuning
is required to get whole out of the sensor.

In future with proper lab environment it can be done, this
is to make this sensor usable.

Signed-off-by: djkabutar <d.kabutarwala@yahoo.com>
